# Index & API Contracts (POC)

## Index location
- `.cursor-wp-index/`
  - `index.sqlite`
  - `blocks.json`, `patterns.json`, `templates.json` (debug exports)

## Minimum SQLite tables
- blocks(id, name, sourceType, path, attrsJson, stylesJson, variationsJson)
- patterns(id, slug, title, path, blockFingerprint, markerSignature)
- templates(id, type, path, blockFingerprint, includesJson)
- content(postId, postType, title, blockFingerprint, markerSignature, contentSearchText)

## Fingerprints
- blockFingerprint: hash of normalized block-name sequence (+ shallow depth hints)
- markerSignature: hash of sorted classes/data-attrs/selectors

## /audit/component response MUST include
- verdict: exists | partial | missing
- bestMatch (if any): type + id/path + enableSteps
- variants: existing + missing + recommended mechanism
- usage: content/templates/patterns matches
- candidates: ranked list with score + reasons[]
- recommendation: reuse/extend/create + lowestRiskApproach
- patchPlan: files + checks + rollback

## /search/similar response MUST include
- queryEcho
- matches grouped by kind: content, patterns, templates, files
- confidence per match + reason markers
